# 02 - HTTP errors by IP
# Purpose: Count 4xx/5xx responses per client IP to spot broken or abusive clients.
# Sourcetype: access_combined* (access_combined_wcookie in the tutorial data)
# Look for: A single IP with a high error count, or many 403/404s from one source.
# Time range: All time (the tutorial dataset is old, so recent ranges return nothing)
# Index: tutorial

index=tutorial sourcetype=access_combined* status>=400
| stats count by clientip, status
| sort -count
